Package: qemu-manager
Version: 7.0-1
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Jishan Shaikh <jishan@qemumanager.org>
Description: QEMU Manager - GUI for managing QEMU virtual machines
 A lightweight GTK4 frontend for QEMU that supports 35 architectures,
 per-VM accelerator selection (TCG/KVM/KVM+LBT), custom binary selection,
 and in-memory execution for PRoot/Termux compatibility.
Depends: libgtk-4-1, libglib2.0-0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
